sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as kmux CLI
    participant K as kmux
    U->>C: kmux open md spec.md
    C->>+K: {"cmd":"open"}
    alt file exists
        K-->>C: running
    else missing
        K-->>C: No such file
    end
    loop every 0.5 s
        K->>K: check file
    end
    Note over C,K: one socket, NDJSON
    K-->>-C: done
